  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_9357.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(40 fotos) La pista polideportiva del Tossalet ha acogido la noche de este viernes una multitudinaria cena con la que se han cerrado los cinco d&iacute;as de fiestas de este barrio perif&eacute;rico de Onda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/IMG_9614.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha cerrado la velada el d&uacute;o flamenco Canelita.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9356.jpg\" alt=\"img_9356\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9357.jpg\" alt=\"img_9357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9359.jpg\" alt=\"img_9359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9360.jpg\" alt=\"img_9360\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9361.jpg\" alt=\"img_9361\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9362.jpg\" alt=\"img_9362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9363.jpg\" alt=\"img_9363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcandelitatossaletagost15/img_9366.jpg\" alt=\"img_9366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\